1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
How to Create a New Fashion Style

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,719
1.

3
00:00:04,719 --> 00:00:07,600
Create a New Fashion Style

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:17,240
Click on the 2D version of the menu, then select the version of the designer.

5
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,679
Next, please select the clothing type.

6
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:24,640
Currently, only the t-shirt is supported, and more options will be added later.

7
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:29,960
Then, according to the style you need to choose, the style of the t-shirt is divided by the sleeve type.

8
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:34,120
At the bottom, you will see the basic measurement data of the clothing.

9
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:39,600
For how to view and adjust your measurement data, you have three different options.

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:45,039
The regular option will provide you with a complete list of common measurement points.

11
00:00:45,039 --> 00:00:50,799
The simple option will provide you with the most common measurement point to simplify the editing process.

12
00:00:50,799 --> 00:00:59,920
The user-defined option allows you to customize your own measurement list and determine the measurement data according to your needs.

13
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:10,400
You can click on the eye icon to select which clothing versions you want to create.

14
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,560
You can switch the version to symmetrical or left-right symmetrical.

15
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:25,280
All measurement options can be used to display all measurement data of the version.

16
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:28,079
Click on the Detailed Information button.

17
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:29,120
You can switch to display all measurement data.

18
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:32,120
to display the list of all measurement information.

19
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:38,120
Select the measurement data that needs to be selected.

20
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,120
After the setting is complete,

21
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:42,120
click the button to change the application.

22
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:48,120
Enter your version measurement value.

23
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:52,120
You can click the reset button next to each measurement data

24
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,120
to restore it to its original value.

25
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:58,120
Some measurement items will contain a total length option

26
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:01,120
used to enter the circumference of the front and back pieces.

27
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:04,120
Some measurement items also contain a pull-down option

28
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:09,120
used to select the measurement location applied to the measurement data.

29
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:12,120
You can click to display all measurement icons

30
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:17,120
to view all non-actual measurement items in each section.

31
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:23,120
Click the Create button to create clothing in the 2D and 3D windows.

32
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:32,120
You can also use the AI version generator to generate data.

33
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:36,120
The AI version generator will automatically generate measurement data

34
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:39,120
and create draft versions for you.

35
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:44,120
Click the AI version generator button in the upper right corner of the version generator.

36
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:47,120
Enter the key word to generate a picture

37
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:50,120
or directly upload a picture to generate the result.

38
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:54,120
Select the clothing type and enter your draft inspiration.

39
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:58,120
Please make sure to add as many descriptive words as possible.

40
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,120
If you want to emphasize certain content,

41
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,120
please put it in the brackets.

42
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,120
Currently, only the T-shape can be selected.

43
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:07,120
Later, more other styles will be introduced.

44
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,120
A small tip.

45
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:11,120
Please try to provide sentences that describe accurate words

46
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,120
and not long sentences

47
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:15,120
to produce more effective results.

48
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:19,120
Click on the Keyword suggestion to display the power key words

49
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:22,120
to help you generate key words.

50
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:25,120
Even if you use the same keyword,

51
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:27,120
the AI picture will be re-created each time.

52
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:30,120
Therefore, click on the Keyword button

53
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:32,120
to update the key words.

54
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:35,120
Keep the existing results as much as possible.

55
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,120
According to the addition or change of key words,

56
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:40,120
the result may be different from the existing result.

57
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:42,120
Click on the Create button at random

58
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:46,120
to add the power key words to the text prompt at random.

59
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:51,120
Click on the Create button to create a picture.

60
00:03:57,120 --> 00:04:03,120
Here are the key words.

61
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:07,120
Click the Clear button to clear all content

62
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,120
to begin the creative process.

63
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,120
Click on the Upload button

64
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:14,120
to add a reference image that is in line with the following guidelines.

65
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:18,120
Use the white background and black linebacker

66
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:21,120
to ensure that the AI image has a high quality.

67
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:25,120
Ensure that the image only has the clothing image.

68
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:29,120
This process can be repeated until you get the desired result.

69
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:34,120
After creating the version, open the simulation and put the costume on the virtual model.

70
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:39,120
That's all for this video. See you in the next video.

